### 5. YAML endpoint pipeline files for the creation flow

The single creation flow is `POST /api/owners`, defined in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`. Full ordered pipeline (each step's `class` under `org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner`):

