One consistency note worth flagging: the `openapi.yml` description (line 2140-2141) says GOLD is based on the *household sharing the same householdId* having 3+ members, but the actual `OwnerMapper` code keys GOLD off `owner.getHouseholdSize() >= 3`, and `AssignHouseholdId` sets `householdSize = household.size() + 1` even when no shared `householdId` is assigned (the `household.isEmpty()` early-return still runs after `setHouseholdSize`). So householdSize counts same-lastName+address peers regardless of whether a householdId was actually assigned.

